- Defines a Task structure for managing task details.
- Implemented a function to initialize an AES-256-CBC cipher context with a given password, using OpenSSL library.
- Implemented a cleanup function to disable the cipher when it is no longer needed.
- Created a function to create tasks with random start and end times within a specified range and without overlaps.
- Implemented a function to print task details upon successful initialization.

Please note that you need to link the OpenSSL library (`-lssl -lcrypto`) when compiling this code. Additionally, remember to ensure proper error handling for various operations in the actual implementation.']

