The implementation uses the reqwest crate for making HTTP requests, which has been shown to be efficient in network-heavy applications. A logging mechanism is incorporated using the log crate for auditing purposes and a monitoring system can be added separately to track request latency and success rates if desired. Extensibility for future features such as additional HTTP methods or protocol support can be achieved by adding new cases in the Method enum and extending the Request struct accordingly.

