- The function has been designed to minimize both time and space complexity by taking advantage of existing data structures and avoiding unnecessary copying or deep nesting of structures.
- To maintain consistency, the function checks for duplicate `RNTI` values during insertion and logs an error without modifying the list if a duplicate is encountered. This ensures that the list remains consistent even in case of memory allocation failures.']

